# Public client configuration ONLY. No database credentials or JWT secrets.
#
# Development (optional): leave unset to use LAN / emulator / localhost detection on port 5000.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
# Physical device: http://<development-machine-LAN-IP>:5000
#
# Production / beta builds embed the Render backend by default via app.config.ts.
# Override only when intentionally pointing a release candidate at another host:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://talos-media-platform.onrender.com
